      "text": "When the ice comes, @USCG crews are breaking through where Americans need it most.\n\nIn the face of the most severe Arctic cold in over a decade, @USCG crews have been conducting vital icebreaking operations from the Great Lakes to the Mid-Atlantic to the Northeast. Through continued icebreaking operations, we’re supporting energy security and facilitating commerce in response to ice impacts to navigation on our waterways.\n\n#USCG #IceBreaking #MTS #commerce @DHSgov @USCGLANTAREA @USCGGreatLakes @USCGNortheast @uscgEast",
