      "text": "31,000 miles of maritime borders. Layered security. Relentless vigilance.\n\nThis past week, @USCG Cutter Forrest Rednour interdicted 14 aliens aboard a 20-foot vessel 18 miles west of San Diego.\n\nAlways ready, our maritime fighting force continues operations to control U.S. borders and maritime approaches, where defense of America begins.\n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation. \nRead more at: https://t.co/6VUPgSHVrS\n\n#USCG #BorderSecurity #MaritimeSecurity #WeOwnTheSea\n@DHSgov",
